\newlabel{fig:refinement_temporal_throughput}{{6}{15}{Geometric mean speedup of total execution time (solid lines) and query throughput (dashed lines) relative to the no-cache baseline. Results are faceted by cardinality estimation strategy (rows) and cache capacity (columns). The Reachability-Aware Estimation row and Large cache column utilize a logarithmic y-axis to accommodate significant performance gains at higher refinement depths}{figure.caption.20}{}}
